# L §3.1: never "a value of type date: later than every date. Ordering against it is allowed (d < never holds);
# arithmetic and aggregation on it are refused (RUN-NONE). A deadline that doesn't exist is a row never."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"

input deadline: date
input d: date

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  deadline = never
  d = 2026-05-01

ask q1: d < deadline, deadline == never, deadline < d
ask q2: add_days(deadline, 1)
=== expect
q1: (true, true, false)
  cut 2026-01-01
q2: refused: RUN-NONE ...
  cut 2026-01-01
